    {
      "seconds": 238.150252499996,
      "state": {
        "status": "completed",
        "error": "",
        "phase": "等待保存",
        "current": 18,
        "total": 18,
        "completed": 18,
        "failed": 0,
        "chunks": [
          {
            "id": "b513d2e38dc4d79ee159259709f6cb5a21206ff1b4daece616843580bafafb89",
            "order": 0,
            "text": "第一節，出發。清晨六點，林先生把筆記本放進背包，沿著河岸慢慢走向車站。昨夜的雨已經停了，路邊的樹葉仍掛著水珠。",
            "separator_after": "",
            "text_sha256": "61dee3b080c2ded6d61162f6f3a19b03599fda6b987b24b81526299c3cd9c2c9",
            "pause_after_ms": 0,
            "settings_sha256": "1fb68a5bfb02019e7bbe868ea9e869dde2d4374084e70dc2e08ae2a398ef4178",
            "rules_sha256": "a4ed0e96494f89b2c408174d2f697b876bb1cfa056a8c2612a4f333fa9655488",
            "status": "completed",
            "attempts": 0,
            "duration_ms": 11400,
            "reused": true,
            "frames": 273600,
            "start_ms": 0,
            "end_ms": 11400
          },
          {
            "id": "4e7417ace9cc134c3178b1752a656c4eb20b19934d9bc3616cab3f0d009aec03",
            "order": 1,
            "text": "他原本打算搭最早的一班車，到山城拜訪一位多年未見的朋友。出門以前，他再次檢查車票、雨傘和水壺，確定沒有遺漏，才輕輕關上家門。",
            "separator_after": "",
            "text_sha256": "7e1c99bbf21aa9d30a587b4800eeff194f7a5670f72188f9e8eec2dc3fbdadec",
            "pause_after_ms": 0,
            "settings_sha256": "1fb68a5bfb02019e7bbe868ea9e869dde2d4374084e70dc2e08ae2a398ef4178",
            "rules_sha256": "a4ed0e96494f89b2c408174d2f697b876bb1cfa056a8c2612a4f333fa9655488",
            "status": "completed",
            "attempts": 1,
            "duration_ms": 13025,
            "reused": false,
            "frames": 312600,
            "start_ms": 11400,
            "end_ms": 24425
          },
          {
            "id": "9c76575c6a33b70f32750480831407bb479ee9ed9860679e81f6b871effda4ea",
            "order": 2,
            "text": "街角的早餐店正在蒸饅頭，空氣裡有一股溫暖的麵香。",
            "separator_after": "\r\n\r\n",
            "text_sha256": "65fd27d228f26bcb8cc937566ef8b99a4d6821ff61055b1dd86c01902c04e196",
            "pause_after_ms": 500,
            "settings_sha256": "1fb68a5bfb02019e7bbe868ea9e869dde2d4374084e70dc2e08ae2a398ef4178",
            "rules_sha256": "a4ed0e96494f89b2c408174d2f697b876bb1cfa056a8c2612a4f333fa9655488",
            "status": "completed",
            "attempts": 1,
            "duration_ms": 5700,
            "reused": false,
            "frames": 136800,
            "start_ms": 24425,
            "end_ms": 30125
          },
          {
            "id": "bae014bc92b86ea25906416367d118ce3ecd3f1218240f7e6bc542c9b0d18de2",
            "order": 3,
            "text": "第二節，候車。月臺上的人不多，有人看報，有人低頭整理行李。一位母親牽著孩子，指向遠方剛升起的太陽。廣播提醒旅客，列車將在十分鐘後進站，請站在安全線後方。",
            "separator_after": "",
            "text_sha256": "1ba6104cf66c8d850f5430bc6d0c71fa1192551c00854ad0c8aaf198b5bfd45c",
            "pause_after_ms": 0,
            "settings_sha256": "1fb68a5bfb02019e7bbe868ea9e869dde2d4374084e70dc2e08ae2a398ef4178",
            "rules_sha256": "a4ed0e96494f89b2c408174d2f697b876bb1cfa056a8c2612a4f333fa9655488",
            "status": "completed",
            "attempts": 1,
            "duration_ms": 15875,
            "reused": false,
            "frames": 381000,
            "start_ms": 30625,
            "end_ms": 46500
          },
          {
            "id": "9e54a465cfd808ca31566506387630a3ad8c720d6150ccf657f2f92863c84357",
            "order": 4,
            "text": "林先生坐在長椅上，翻開筆記本，寫下今天想問朋友的三個問題。他沒有急著列出答案，只在每個問題旁邊留了一小段空白。",
            "separator_after": "\r\n\r\n",
            "text_sha256": "3db484403cfbee42864765a0d5a8e34dd86edbf5a6389fa3cfa25bb07592c4c8",
            "pause_after_ms": 500,
            "settings_sha256": "1fb68a5bfb02019e7bbe868ea9e869dde2d4374084e70dc2e08ae2a398ef4178",
            "rules_sha256": "a4ed0e96494f89b2c408174d2f697b876bb1cfa056a8c2612a4f333fa9655488",
            "status": "completed",
            "attempts": 1,
            "duration_ms": 11600,
            "reused": false,
            "frames": 278400,
            "start_ms": 46500,
            "end_ms": 58100
          },
          {
            "id": "e35e9916873a92b9ffa438d7f964d3ba4af53b49ccc8c848cf2baefef94f21a2",
            "order": 5,
            "text": "第三節，窗景。列車離開城市以後，高樓逐漸被稻田取代。風從半開的窗戶吹進來，帶著泥土和青草的氣味。鐵橋下的溪水很清，幾隻白鳥站在淺灘上，一動也不動。",
            "separator_after": "",
            "text_sha256": "2372b01831c3fc764b960b1d7260fc7855bcba8c4c92f809ee0b2e512302c237",
            "pause_after_ms": 0,
            "settings_sha256": "1fb68a5bfb02019e7bbe868ea9e869dde2d4374084e70dc2e08ae2a398ef4178",
            "rules_sha256": "a4ed0e96494f89b2c408174d2f697b876bb1cfa056a8c2612a4f333fa9655488",
            "status": "completed",
            "attempts": 1,
            "duration_ms": 14875,
            "reused": false,
            "frames": 357000,
            "start_ms": 58600,
            "end_ms": 73475
          },
          {
            "id": "8f88fe5cf831a1888ca68feaec6598bef55025ec48682c9d211f5c2f8ab01507",
            "order": 6,
            "text": "林先生想起小時候，父親常帶他到這條溪邊散步。當時他總覺得路很長，現在才發現，許多記憶只需要一個轉彎就會回來。",
            "separator_after": "\r\n\r\n",
            "text_sha256": "14db82652cee80b3c642a8818a7a86eaccad9b0b79c6da2b50f987c07626bf90",
            "pause_after_ms": 500,
            "settings_sha256": "1fb68a5bfb02019e7bbe868ea9e869dde2d4374084e70dc2e08ae2a398ef4178",
            "rules_sha256": "a4ed0e96494f89b2c408174d2f697b876bb1cfa056a8c2612a4f333fa9655488",
            "status": "completed",
            "attempts": 1,
            "duration_ms": 11550,
            "reused": false,
            "frames": 277200,
            "start_ms": 73475,
            "end_ms": 85025
          },
          {
            "id": "1b7a3c1cabd692c08a474510015c8a5dbf376c16ac1c30eb8361935e421da7d6",
            "order": 7,
            "text": "第四節，相見。到了山城，朋友已經站在出口等候。兩人先握了握手，接著忍不住笑了起來。他們走進市場旁的小茶館，點了一壺熱茶和兩盤點心。",
            "separator_after": "",
            "text_sha256": "ef18fa31d021d801dd8286e87233b429aa476d1fcc9add99628716a977bad7f2",
            "pause_after_ms": 0,
            "settings_sha256": "1fb68a5bfb02019e7bbe868ea9e869dde2d4374084e70dc2e08ae2a398ef4178",
            "rules_sha256": "a4ed0e96494f89b2c408174d2f697b876bb1cfa056a8c2612a4f333fa9655488",
            "status": "completed",
            "attempts": 1,
            "duration_ms": 13325,
            "reused": false,
            "frames": 319800,
            "start_ms": 85525,
            "end_ms": 98850
          },
          {
            "id": "f405af9a3e579e41e35396ffac8ba03b08a0250c13d264df123a63cd497c4cad",
            "order": 8,
            "text": "朋友說，這幾年小鎮改變很多，老戲院變成展覽館，舊倉庫也重新開放。不過，每到傍晚，居民仍然習慣坐在門前聊天，等山上的霧慢慢降下來。",
            "separator_after": "\r\n\r\n",
            "text_sha256": "1fd4b4ac7e4dbeeae5e7e131dff417e194333db3c2929545ff990c80b3e4fc41",
            "pause_after_ms": 500,
            "settings_sha256": "1fb68a5bfb02019e7bbe868ea9e869dde2d4374084e70dc2e08ae2a398ef4178",
            "rules_sha256": "a4ed0e96494f89b2c408174d2f697b876bb1cfa056a8c2612a4f333fa9655488",
            "status": "completed",
            "attempts": 1,
            "duration_ms": 13475,
            "reused": false,
            "frames": 323400,
            "start_ms": 98850,
            "end_ms": 112325
          },
          {
            "id": "8f1ec61e62d2d207289087d163c4e1410f5bbafb12f818e045918f76e8a3513e",
            "order": 9,
            "text": "第五節，舊書。午飯後，他們到一間二手書店。店主把新收的書擺在木桌上，請客人自行翻閱。其中有一本旅行日記，封面已經褪色，內頁卻保存完整。",
            "separator_after": "",
            "text_sha256": "b03199bdeb495dba2a490c2962a93cd9bd9baaea696ba7976cb8cf97945611a1",
            "pause_after_ms": 0,
            "settings_sha256": "1fb68a5bfb02019e7bbe868ea9e869dde2d4374084e70dc2e08ae2a398ef4178",
            "rules_sha256": "a4ed0e96494f89b2c408174d2f697b876bb1cfa056a8c2612a4f333fa9655488",
            "status": "completed",
            "attempts": 1,
            "duration_ms": 13475,
            "reused": false,
            "frames": 323400,
            "start_ms": 112825,
            "end_ms": 126300
          },
          {
            "id": "a8938ddfba048036203535809af35f89ae069e7d100c0c6ebdf9de1298a348a7",
            "order": 10,
            "text": "作者用簡短的句子記錄天氣、路線和沿途遇見的人。林先生讀到一段話，忽然停了下來：走得快，不一定看得多；願意停留，才有機會看見細節。他把書買下，準備帶回家慢慢閱讀。",
            "separator_after": "\r\n\r\n",
            "text_sha256": "22dd1f96a8aa3cffd9d1b00723a745a72018e72e68441e06471d5495ff29f14e",
            "pause_after_ms": 500,
            "settings_sha256": "1fb68a5bfb02019e7bbe868ea9e869dde2d4374084e70dc2e08ae2a398ef4178",
            "rules_sha256": "a4ed0e96494f89b2c408174d2f697b876bb1cfa056a8c2612a4f333fa9655488",
            "status": "completed",
            "attempts": 1,
            "duration_ms": 15925,
            "reused": false,
            "frames": 382200,
            "start_ms": 126300,
            "end_ms": 142225
          },
          {
            "id": "73f75645eb10bf63fa24c51f235b1450f4da5b4c992b05e994384aadb3a56f2c",
            "order": 11,
            "text": "第六節，山路。下午的陽光穿過竹林，照在彎曲的石階上。朋友帶他走一條較平緩的小路，途中經過茶園、水池和一座小橋。兩人遇到一位整理菜圃的老人，便停下來問路。",
            "separator_after": "",
            "text_sha256": "e03a0980d7287150e3f4820fac7716394d28402e466c8c3057ff0d2b91533168",
            "pause_after_ms": 0,
            "settings_sha256": "1fb68a5bfb02019e7bbe868ea9e869dde2d4374084e70dc2e08ae2a398ef4178",
            "rules_sha256": "a4ed0e96494f89b2c408174d2f697b876bb1cfa056a8c2612a4f333fa9655488",
            "status": "completed",
            "attempts": 1,
            "duration_ms": 15750,
            "reused": false,
            "frames": 378000,
            "start_ms": 142725,
            "end_ms": 158475
          },
          {
            "id": "cb3bdc9b0348f4a39371ce06e7487415e8aea292cf7d01b2902e8622fd4d20e4",
            "order": 12,
            "text": "老人提醒他們，前方的階梯有些濕滑，最好靠右行走。他們道謝後繼續前進，沒有趕時間，也沒有試著一次走完所有景點。",
            "separator_after": "\r\n\r\n",
            "text_sha256": "4f7d866c4f0c97e6a54e3890a5ca1814a8838b5e47c6e6fd75d938bbec88e547",
            "pause_after_ms": 500,
            "settings_sha256": "1fb68a5bfb02019e7bbe868ea9e869dde2d4374084e70dc2e08ae2a398ef4178",
            "rules_sha256": "a4ed0e96494f89b2c408174d2f697b876bb1cfa056a8c2612a4f333fa9655488",
            "status": "completed",
            "attempts": 1,
            "duration_ms": 11100,
            "reused": false,
            "frames": 266400,
            "start_ms": 158475,
            "end_ms": 169575
          },
          {
            "id": "80a36175a7c1242779b7ef1cd99d78e3d19f19239a13ea30cad24cdea963b1b7",
            "order": 13,
            "text": "第七節，回程。傍晚五點，天空開始轉暗，遠處的燈一盞接著一盞亮起。林先生和朋友在車站告別，約好下次一起去看海。回程的車廂比早上安靜，有些旅客已經睡著。",
            "separator_after": "",
            "text_sha256": "87749baad4bed0e991a203fda8ddadca121f79d753dbfb5357b8c3d15abc243a",
            "pause_after_ms": 0,
            "settings_sha256": "1fb68a5bfb02019e7bbe868ea9e869dde2d4374084e70dc2e08ae2a398ef4178",
            "rules_sha256": "a4ed0e96494f89b2c408174d2f697b876bb1cfa056a8c2612a4f333fa9655488",
            "status": "completed",
            "attempts": 1,
            "duration_ms": 14950,
            "reused": false,
            "frames": 358800,
            "start_ms": 170075,
            "end_ms": 185025
          },
          {
            "id": "a872ebfe3891d50f47fdd102c8cb8d4cf2f915b58b83cd37df182ec0bc62f49b",
            "order": 14,
            "text": "他靠著椅背，想起今天聽到的故事，才發現筆記本裡的三個問題，已經有了不同於出發前的意義。那些空白不是忘記填寫，而是留給以後繼續思考。",
            "separator_after": "\r\n\r\n",
            "text_sha256": "7de52b37f3feb282dc4f3cacfbbc7b1cde2ed5396cf08a4edd59f350bc83ccdc",
            "pause_after_ms": 500,
            "settings_sha256": "1fb68a5bfb02019e7bbe868ea9e869dde2d4374084e70dc2e08ae2a398ef4178",
            "rules_sha256": "a4ed0e96494f89b2c408174d2f697b876bb1cfa056a8c2612a4f333fa9655488",
            "status": "completed",
            "attempts": 1,
            "duration_ms": 13350,
            "reused": false,
            "frames": 320400,
            "start_ms": 185025,
            "end_ms": 198375
          },
          {
            "id": "79b753d58ccd420f96be7f928b64899f560dbe604f3e23521043b1b51a266bce",
            "order": 15,
            "text": "第八節，歸來。回到家，他先把雨傘晾好，再把新買的舊書放到桌上。窗外傳來幾聲短短的鳥鳴，街道也逐漸恢復夜晚的平靜。",
            "separator_after": "",
            "text_sha256": "89a237fb3d91be1325db1a74b0db681a221e85b73045a58abe85749124d2f5fc",
            "pause_after_ms": 0,
            "settings_sha256": "1fb68a5bfb02019e7bbe868ea9e869dde2d4374084e70dc2e08ae2a398ef4178",
            "rules_sha256": "a4ed0e96494f89b2c408174d2f697b876bb1cfa056a8c2612a4f333fa9655488",
            "status": "completed",
            "attempts": 1,
            "duration_ms": 11400,
            "reused": false,
            "frames": 273600,
            "start_ms": 198875,
            "end_ms": 210275
          },
          {
            "id": "570899fd1aed8c5b896b1d86777ecce17fe51ad9562df711c5316b887e83c109",
            "order": 16,
            "text": "他沒有立刻開啟電腦，而是倒了一杯水，把今天的路線畫在紙上。最後，他在頁尾寫道：旅程已經結束，但對朋友的理解還會繼續。",
            "separator_after": "",
            "text_sha256": "1e3666df2fb277f70da88854e7636948860a342ddcbdec60daee5432eba42a2e",
            "pause_after_ms": 0,
            "settings_sha256": "1fb68a5bfb02019e7bbe868ea9e869dde2d4374084e70dc2e08ae2a398ef4178",
            "rules_sha256": "a4ed0e96494f89b2c408174d2f697b876bb1cfa056a8c2612a4f333fa9655488",
            "status": "completed",
            "attempts": 1,
            "duration_ms": 12000,
            "reused": false,
            "frames": 288000,
            "start_ms": 210275,
            "end_ms": 222275
          },
          {
            "id": "e2cda98fa153fb28009b8a7e26fd2745d56b5f0cd629c332d28d17cadce49dd6",
            "order": 17,
            "text": "這是長段落測試的最後一句，請確認整句完整保留，並聽見最後的結束標記：晚安。",
            "separator_after": "",
            "text_sha256": "87f30d8538a8ac95be260b934542749d9922e5f83df90049b88be7dad0988f5e",
            "pause_after_ms": 0,
            "settings_sha256": "1fb68a5bfb02019e7bbe868ea9e869dde2d4374084e70dc2e08ae2a398ef4178",
            "rules_sha256": "a4ed0e96494f89b2c408174d2f697b876bb1cfa056a8c2612a4f333fa9655488",
            "status": "completed",
            "attempts": 1,
            "duration_ms": 7800,
            "reused": false,
            "frames": 187200,
            "start_ms": 222275,
            "end_ms": 230075
          }
        ],
        "resume_history": [
          {
            "status": "cancelled",
            "phase": "已取消",
            "current": 2,
            "total": 18,
            "completed": 1,
            "failed": 0,
            "error": "",
            "chunks": [
              {
                "id": "b513d2e38dc4d79ee159259709f6cb5a21206ff1b4daece616843580bafafb89",
                "order": 0,
                "text": "第一節，出發。清晨六點，林先生把筆記本放進背包，沿著河岸慢慢走向車站。昨夜的雨已經停了，路邊的樹葉仍掛著水珠。",
                "separator_after": "",
                "text_sha256": "61dee3b080c2ded6d61162f6f3a19b03599fda6b987b24b81526299c3cd9c2c9",
                "pause_after_ms": 0,
                "settings_sha256": "1fb68a5bfb02019e7bbe868ea9e869dde2d4374084e70dc2e08ae2a398ef4178",
                "rules_sha256": "a4ed0e96494f89b2c408174d2f697b876bb1cfa056a8c2612a4f333fa9655488",
                "status": "completed",
                "attempts": 1,
                "duration_ms": 11400,
                "reused": false,
                "frames": 273600,
                "start_ms": 0,
                "end_ms": 11400
              },
              {
                "id": "4e7417ace9cc134c3178b1752a656c4eb20b19934d9bc3616cab3f0d009aec03",
                "order": 1,
                "text": "他原本打算搭最早的一班車，到山城拜訪一位多年未見的朋友。出門以前，他再次檢查車票、雨傘和水壺，確定沒有遺漏，才輕輕關上家門。",
                "separator_after": "",
                "text_sha256": "7e1c99bbf21aa9d30a587b4800eeff194f7a5670f72188f9e8eec2dc3fbdadec",
                "pause_after_ms": 0,
                "settings_sha256": "1fb68a5bfb02019e7bbe868ea9e869dde2d4374084e70dc2e08ae2a398ef4178",
                "rules_sha256": "a4ed0e96494f89b2c408174d2f697b876bb1cfa056a8c2612a4f333fa9655488",
                "status": "cancelled",
                "attempts": 1,
                "duration_ms": null
              },
              {
                "id": "9c76575c6a33b70f32750480831407bb479ee9ed9860679e81f6b871effda4ea",
                "order": 2,
                "text": "街角的早餐店正在蒸饅頭，空氣裡有一股溫暖的麵香。",
                "separator_after": "\r\n\r\n",
                "text_sha256": "65fd27d228f26bcb8cc937566ef8b99a4d6821ff61055b1dd86c01902c04e196",
                "pause_after_ms": 500,
                "settings_sha256": "1fb68a5bfb02019e7bbe868ea9e869dde2d4374084e70dc2e08ae2a398ef4178",
                "rules_sha256": "a4ed0e96494f89b2c408174d2f697b876bb1cfa056a8c2612a4f333fa9655488",
                "status": "pending",
                "attempts": 0,
                "duration_ms": null
              },
              {
                "id": "bae014bc92b86ea25906416367d118ce3ecd3f1218240f7e6bc542c9b0d18de2",
                "order": 3,
                "text": "第二節，候車。月臺上的人不多，有人看報，有人低頭整理行李。一位母親牽著孩子，指向遠方剛升起的太陽。廣播提醒旅客，列車將在十分鐘後進站，請站在安全線後方。",
                "separator_after": "",
                "text_sha256": "1ba6104cf66c8d850f5430bc6d0c71fa1192551c00854ad0c8aaf198b5bfd45c",
                "pause_after_ms": 0,
                "settings_sha256": "1fb68a5bfb02019e7bbe868ea9e869dde2d4374084e70dc2e08ae2a398ef4178",
                "rules_sha256": "a4ed0e96494f89b2c408174d2f697b876bb1cfa056a8c2612a4f333fa9655488",
                "status": "pending",
                "attempts": 0,
                "duration_ms": null
              },
              {
                "id": "9e54a465cfd808ca31566506387630a3ad8c720d6150ccf657f2f92863c84357",
                "order": 4,
                "text": "林先生坐在長椅上，翻開筆記本，寫下今天想問朋友的三個問題。他沒有急著列出答案，只在每個問題旁邊留了一小段空白。",
                "separator_after": "\r\n\r\n",
                "text_sha256": "3db484403cfbee42864765a0d5a8e34dd86edbf5a6389fa3cfa25bb07592c4c8",
                "pause_after_ms": 500,
                "settings_sha256": "1fb68a5bfb02019e7bbe868ea9e869dde2d4374084e70dc2e08ae2a398ef4178",
                "rules_sha256": "a4ed0e96494f89b2c408174d2f697b876bb1cfa056a8c2612a4f333fa9655488",
                "status": "pending",
                "attempts": 0,
                "duration_ms": null
              },
              {
                "id": "e35e9916873a92b9ffa438d7f964d3ba4af53b49ccc8c848cf2baefef94f21a2",
                "order": 5,
                "text": "第三節，窗景。列車離開城市以後，高樓逐漸被稻田取代。風從半開的窗戶吹進來，帶著泥土和青草的氣味。鐵橋下的溪水很清，幾隻白鳥站在淺灘上，一動也不動。",
                "separator_after": "",
                "text_sha256": "2372b01831c3fc764b960b1d7260fc7855bcba8c4c92f809ee0b2e512302c237",
                "pause_after_ms": 0,
                "settings_sha256": "1fb68a5bfb02019e7bbe868ea9e869dde2d4374084e70dc2e08ae2a398ef4178",
                "rules_sha256": "a4ed0e96494f89b2c408174d2f697b876bb1cfa056a8c2612a4f333fa9655488",
                "status": "pending",
                "attempts": 0,
                "duration_ms": null
              },
              {
                "id": "8f88fe5cf831a1888ca68feaec6598bef55025ec48682c9d211f5c2f8ab01507",
                "order": 6,
                "text": "林先生想起小時候，父親常帶他到這條溪邊散步。當時他總覺得路很長，現在才發現，許多記憶只需要一個轉彎就會回來。",
                "separator_after": "\r\n\r\n",
                "text_sha256": "14db82652cee80b3c642a8818a7a86eaccad9b0b79c6da2b50f987c07626bf90",
                "pause_after_ms": 500,
                "settings_sha256": "1fb68a5bfb02019e7bbe868ea9e869dde2d4374084e70dc2e08ae2a398ef4178",
                "rules_sha256": "a4ed0e96494f89b2c408174d2f697b876bb1cfa056a8c2612a4f333fa9655488",
                "status": "pending",
                "attempts": 0,
                "duration_ms": null
              },
              {
                "id": "1b7a3c1cabd692c08a474510015c8a5dbf376c16ac1c30eb8361935e421da7d6",
                "order": 7,
                "text": "第四節，相見。到了山城，朋友已經站在出口等候。兩人先握了握手，接著忍不住笑了起來。他們走進市場旁的小茶館，點了一壺熱茶和兩盤點心。",
                "separator_after": "",
                "text_sha256": "ef18fa31d021d801dd8286e87233b429aa476d1fcc9add99628716a977bad7f2",
                "pause_after_ms": 0,
                "settings_sha256": "1fb68a5bfb02019e7bbe868ea9e869dde2d4374084e70dc2e08ae2a398ef4178",
                "rules_sha256": "a4ed0e96494f89b2c408174d2f697b876bb1cfa056a8c2612a4f333fa9655488",
                "status": "pending",
                "attempts": 0,
                "duration_ms": null
              },
              {
                "id": "f405af9a3e579e41e35396ffac8ba03b08a0250c13d264df123a63cd497c4cad",
                "order": 8,
                "text": "朋友說，這幾年小鎮改變很多，老戲院變成展覽館，舊倉庫也重新開放。不過，每到傍晚，居民仍然習慣坐在門前聊天，等山上的霧慢慢降下來。",
                "separator_after": "\r\n\r\n",
                "text_sha256": "1fd4b4ac7e4dbeeae5e7e131dff417e194333db3c2929545ff990c80b3e4fc41",
                "pause_after_ms": 500,
                "settings_sha256": "1fb68a5bfb02019e7bbe868ea9e869dde2d4374084e70dc2e08ae2a398ef4178",
                "rules_sha256": "a4ed0e96494f89b2c408174d2f697b876bb1cfa056a8c2612a4f333fa9655488",
                "status": "pending",
                "attempts": 0,
                "duration_ms": null
              },
              {
                "id": "8f1ec61e62d2d207289087d163c4e1410f5bbafb12f818e045918f76e8a3513e",
                "order": 9,
                "text": "第五節，舊書。午飯後，他們到一間二手書店。店主把新收的書擺在木桌上，請客人自行翻閱。其中有一本旅行日記，封面已經褪色，內頁卻保存完整。",
                "separator_after": "",
                "text_sha256": "b03199bdeb495dba2a490c2962a93cd9bd9baaea696ba7976cb8cf97945611a1",
                "pause_after_ms": 0,
                "settings_sha256": "1fb68a5bfb02019e7bbe868ea9e869dde2d4374084e70dc2e08ae2a398ef4178",
                "rules_sha256": "a4ed0e96494f89b2c408174d2f697b876bb1cfa056a8c2612a4f333fa9655488",
                "status": "pending",
                "attempts": 0,
                "duration_ms": null
              },
              {
                "id": "a8938ddfba048036203535809af35f89ae069e7d100c0c6ebdf9de1298a348a7",
                "order": 10,
                "text": "作者用簡短的句子記錄天氣、路線和沿途遇見的人。林先生讀到一段話，忽然停了下來：走得快，不一定看得多；願意停留，才有機會看見細節。他把書買下，準備帶回家慢慢閱讀。",
                "separator_after": "\r\n\r\n",
                "text_sha256": "22dd1f96a8aa3cffd9d1b00723a745a72018e72e68441e06471d5495ff29f14e",
                "pause_after_ms": 500,
                "settings_sha256": "1fb68a5bfb02019e7bbe868ea9e869dde2d4374084e70dc2e08ae2a398ef4178",
                "rules_sha256": "a4ed0e96494f89b2c408174d2f697b876bb1cfa056a8c2612a4f333fa9655488",
                "status": "pending",
                "attempts": 0,
                "duration_ms": null
              },
              {
                "id": "73f75645eb10bf63fa24c51f235b1450f4da5b4c992b05e994384aadb3a56f2c",
                "order": 11,
                "text": "第六節，山路。下午的陽光穿過竹林，照在彎曲的石階上。朋友帶他走一條較平緩的小路，途中經過茶園、水池和一座小橋。兩人遇到一位整理菜圃的老人，便停下來問路。",
                "separator_after": "",
                "text_sha256": "e03a0980d7287150e3f4820fac7716394d28402e466c8c3057ff0d2b91533168",
                "pause_after_ms": 0,
                "settings_sha256": "1fb68a5bfb02019e7bbe868ea9e869dde2d4374084e70dc2e08ae2a398ef4178",
                "rules_sha256": "a4ed0e96494f89b2c408174d2f697b876bb1cfa056a8c2612a4f333fa9655488",
                "status": "pending",
                "attempts": 0,
                "duration_ms": null
              },
              {
                "id": "cb3bdc9b0348f4a39371ce06e7487415e8aea292cf7d01b2902e8622fd4d20e4",
                "order": 12,
                "text": "老人提醒他們，前方的階梯有些濕滑，最好靠右行走。他們道謝後繼續前進，沒有趕時間，也沒有試著一次走完所有景點。",
                "separator_after": "\r\n\r\n",
                "text_sha256": "4f7d866c4f0c97e6a54e3890a5ca1814a8838b5e47c6e6fd75d938bbec88e547",
                "pause_after_ms": 500,
                "settings_sha256": "1fb68a5bfb02019e7bbe868ea9e869dde2d4374084e70dc2e08ae2a398ef4178",
                "rules_sha256": "a4ed0e96494f89b2c408174d2f697b876bb1cfa056a8c2612a4f333fa9655488",
                "status": "pending",
                "attempts": 0,
                "duration_ms": null
              },
              {
                "id": "80a36175a7c1242779b7ef1cd99d78e3d19f19239a13ea30cad24cdea963b1b7",
                "order": 13,
                "text": "第七節，回程。傍晚五點，天空開始轉暗，遠處的燈一盞接著一盞亮起。林先生和朋友在車站告別，約好下次一起去看海。回程的車廂比早上安靜，有些旅客已經睡著。",
                "separator_after": "",
                "text_sha256": "87749baad4bed0e991a203fda8ddadca121f79d753dbfb5357b8c3d15abc243a",
                "pause_after_ms": 0,
                "settings_sha256": "1fb68a5bfb02019e7bbe868ea9e869dde2d4374084e70dc2e08ae2a398ef4178",
                "rules_sha256": "a4ed0e96494f89b2c408174d2f697b876bb1cfa056a8c2612a4f333fa9655488",
                "status": "pending",
                "attempts": 0,
                "duration_ms": null
              },
              {
                "id": "a872ebfe3891d50f47fdd102c8cb8d4cf2f915b58b83cd37df182ec0bc62f49b",
                "order": 14,
                "text": "他靠著椅背，想起今天聽到的故事，才發現筆記本裡的三個問題，已經有了不同於出發前的意義。那些空白不是忘記填寫，而是留給以後繼續思考。",
                "separator_after": "\r\n\r\n",
                "text_sha256": "7de52b37f3feb282dc4f3cacfbbc7b1cde2ed5396cf08a4edd59f350bc83ccdc",
                "pause_after_ms": 500,
                "settings_sha256": "1fb68a5bfb02019e7bbe868ea9e869dde2d4374084e70dc2e08ae2a398ef4178",
                "rules_sha256": "a4ed0e96494f89b2c408174d2f697b876bb1cfa056a8c2612a4f333fa9655488",
                "status": "pending",
                "attempts": 0,
                "duration_ms": null
              },
              {
                "id": "79b753d58ccd420f96be7f928b64899f560dbe604f3e23521043b1b51a266bce",
                "order": 15,
                "text": "第八節，歸來。回到家，他先把雨傘晾好，再把新買的舊書放到桌上。窗外傳來幾聲短短的鳥鳴，街道也逐漸恢復夜晚的平靜。",
                "separator_after": "",
                "text_sha256": "89a237fb3d91be1325db1a74b0db681a221e85b73045a58abe85749124d2f5fc",
                "pause_after_ms": 0,
                "settings_sha256": "1fb68a5bfb02019e7bbe868ea9e869dde2d4374084e70dc2e08ae2a398ef4178",
                "rules_sha256": "a4ed0e96494f89b2c408174d2f697b876bb1cfa056a8c2612a4f333fa9655488",
                "status": "pending",
                "attempts": 0,
                "duration_ms": null
              },
              {
                "id": "570899fd1aed8c5b896b1d86777ecce17fe51ad9562df711c5316b887e83c109",
                "order": 16,
                "text": "他沒有立刻開啟電腦，而是倒了一杯水，把今天的路線畫在紙上。最後，他在頁尾寫道：旅程已經結束，但對朋友的理解還會繼續。",
                "separator_after": "",
                "text_sha256": "1e3666df2fb277f70da88854e7636948860a342ddcbdec60daee5432eba42a2e",
                "pause_after_ms": 0,
                "settings_sha256": "1fb68a5bfb02019e7bbe868ea9e869dde2d4374084e70dc2e08ae2a398ef4178",
                "rules_sha256": "a4ed0e96494f89b2c408174d2f697b876bb1cfa056a8c2612a4f333fa9655488",
                "status": "pending",
                "attempts": 0,
                "duration_ms": null
              },
              {
                "id": "e2cda98fa153fb28009b8a7e26fd2745d56b5f0cd629c332d28d17cadce49dd6",
                "order": 17,
                "text": "這是長段落測試的最後一句，請確認整句完整保留，並聽見最後的結束標記：晚安。",
                "separator_after": "",
                "text_sha256": "87f30d8538a8ac95be260b934542749d9922e5f83df90049b88be7dad0988f5e",
                "pause_after_ms": 0,
                "settings_sha256": "1fb68a5bfb02019e7bbe868ea9e869dde2d4374084e70dc2e08ae2a398ef4178",
                "rules_sha256": "a4ed0e96494f89b2c408174d2f697b876bb1cfa056a8c2612a4f333fa9655488",
                "status": "pending",
                "attempts": 0,
                "duration_ms": null
              }
            ],
            "retry_deadline": null
          }
        ],
